{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEG is a puzzle game about guessing rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character in the game represents its own rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing you can do is click cells until all the rules are satisfied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 18 never-before-seen rules and mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over 600 unique handcrafted puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Discover hidden puzzles inside and outside the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Solve Meta puzzles and an ultimate final puzzle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No language required, accessible to players worldwide</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- More than 20 relaxing and atmospheric music tracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Minimalistic hand-drawn art style</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044990?t=1759283175","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044990?t=1759283175","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044990/7961e28d96ec7a9883ba9a11a9bdb45509df97f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759283175","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044990/7961e28d96ec7a9883ba9a11a9bdb45509df97f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759283175","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEG is a puzzle game about guessing rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character in the game represents its own rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing you can do is click cells until all the rules are satisfied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p>